Z||000005||stimpy||12-05-2001||09:39 PM||||Hey cali kid, I don't know about a bass sub, but I have had some tuna hoagies that were alright.<P>(You see Jeffery,it's a joke. A play on words if you will. Part of your introductery hazing.)<P>Here's my subwoofer install.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/pffinterior.jpg">  <BR>Behind the seat was way to much hassle for me, as I am 6'6" and have to keep both seats all the way back in order to see ok. There are also console enclosures that look very nice. Use the "search" function for subwoofer and you'll have threads of ideas for days.||||reg||1
